flowchart TD
    Init["init_net (default ns)"]
    A["netns A (created via 'ip netns add A')"]
    B["netns B"]

    Init -- "physical eth0 here" --> Eth0["eth0 (physical NIC)"]

    A -- "veth pair" --> VethA["vethA0"]
    A -- "loopback" --> LoA["lo"]
    Init -- "veth peer" --> VethB["vethA1 (peer)"]

    Br["bridge br0 (in init_net)"] --> VethB
    Br --> Eth0

    Note1["Movement:<br/>ip link set vethA0 netns A<br/>ip netns exec A bash<br/>(unshare CLONE_NEWNET)"]

    Note2["Each ns has own:<br/>- routing table (ip route)<br/>- iptables rules (sudo nft list ruleset)<br/>- /proc/net/* views<br/>- sockets/listeners<br/>- conntrack zone"]

    A -.- Note1
    A -.- Note2

    classDef ns fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb
    classDef phys fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706
    classDef veth fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a
    class Init,A,B ns
    class Eth0,Br phys
    class VethA,VethB,LoA veth
